# EV Charging Station API - Complete Frontend Developer Testing Guide

This guide provides step-by-step instructions for testing every API endpoint with expected responses. Follow this guide to ensure successful integration with the frontend application.

## 🚀 Quick Setup

### Base URL
```
Development: https://localhost:{port}
Production: {your-production-url}
```

### Authentication
All authenticated endpoints require JWT token in the Authorization header:
```
Authorization: Bearer {your_jwt_token}
```

### Content Type
All POST/PUT requests require:
```
Content-Type: application/json
```

