## 📋 SECTION 1: EV OWNER REGISTRATION & AUTHENTICATION

### 1.1 Register New EV Owner ✅

**Endpoint:** `POST /api/evownerauth/register`  
**Access:** Public  
**Purpose:** Create new EV owner account

**Request:**
```json
{
  "nic": "123456789V",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "+94771234567",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

**Success Response (200):**
```json
{
  "message": "Registration successful",
  "evOwner": {
    "nic": "123456789V",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "phone": "+94771234567",
    "isActive": true
  }
}
```

**Error Responses:**
- **400 Bad Request:** Duplicate NIC/Email or validation errors
- **500 Internal Server Error:** Server issues

**Frontend Integration Notes:**
- Validate password (min 6 chars) before sending
- Handle duplicate account errors gracefully
- Show success message and redirect to login

